Objective: Gain Control of the entire planet in 150 turns

Planet: Splatterscape
Clan: Crimson Path

Notes: While we have the raw materials for the new weapons, our own industrial facilities are not adequate to use them.  We must capture some concord facilities.

Splatterscape is directly controlled by a Concord member. It has many facilities amongst the human population. The Seven Knights clansmen have been put in charge of the defenses of this planet. You land in in an out-of-the-way island. You must build yourself up before you are spotted.

Current intelligence states the alien has no vehicle plants. The Seven Knights have one constructor and one engineer.

